<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's 12-month T-bill yield rises to 22.77 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's 12-month T-bill yield rises to 22.77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's 12-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.77 percent, up from 22.72 at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Centre said on Friday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	24.519.68 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    14,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 15,500 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	   22.77 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		    81.5775 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
